1
00:00:09,000 --> 00:00:10,000
[Killua] But how?

2
00:00:11,000 --> 00:00:12,000
Stop.

3
00:00:13,000 --> 00:00:15,000
How did you know?

4
00:00:28,000 --> 00:00:30,000
[opening theme music playing]

5
00:01:30,000 --> 00:01:31,000
[singer singing in English]

6
00:01:32,000 --> 00:01:34,000
[singer singing in Japanese]

7
00:02:11,000 --> 00:02:14,000
[narrator] At long last,
the time has come.

8
00:02:14,000 --> 00:02:15,000
[heart beating]

9
00:02:16,000 --> 00:02:17,000
[Queen screams]

10
00:02:22,000 --> 00:02:23,000
[all gasp]

11
00:02:24,000 --> 00:02:27,000
-Is it time now?
-Mmm-hmm.

12
00:02:28,000 --> 00:02:29,000
It's the birth of the King.

13
00:02:42,000 --> 00:02:45,000
Wait. It's too early.

14
00:02:45,000 --> 00:02:46,000
[King] Shut up!

15
00:03:50,000 --> 00:03:52,000
Now then, I'm quite famished.

16
00:03:53,000 --> 00:03:55,000
Go and prepare me a feast.

17
00:03:57,000 --> 00:03:59,000
-[Colt] This… this is our King.
-[chorus fades]

18
00:04:02,000 --> 00:04:03,000
[panting]

19
00:04:04,000 --> 00:04:05,000
[Queen gagging]

20
00:04:05,000 --> 00:04:06,000
[gasps]

21
00:04:07,000 --> 00:04:08,000
Your Majesty!

22
00:04:09,000 --> 00:04:13,000
This is terrible.
Her organs have been severely damaged!

23
00:04:13,000 --> 00:04:14,000
[gasps]

24
00:04:19,000 --> 00:04:21,000
[all gasping]

25
00:04:59,000 --> 00:05:00,000
-You.
-[Colt gasps]

26
00:05:03,000 --> 00:05:04,000
Clean it.

27
00:05:17,000 --> 00:05:20,000
[laughs] Would you look at that?

28
00:05:32,000 --> 00:05:33,000
Clean it.

29
00:06:06,000 --> 00:06:07,000
[King] Where is my food?

30
00:06:08,000 --> 00:06:09,000
[Shaiapouf] This way.

31
00:06:09,000 --> 00:06:10,000
[Cheetu] Huh?

32
00:06:13,000 --> 00:06:16,000
We have prepared a meal for you, my King.

33
00:06:16,000 --> 00:06:20,000
Your Highness, the three of us will be
honored to be your devoted servants.

34
00:06:21,000 --> 00:06:23,000
You wish is our command, Your Majesty.

35
00:06:24,000 --> 00:06:27,000
We will fulfill all your earthly desires.

36
00:06:28,000 --> 00:06:31,000
We await your command
with patience, Majesty.

37
00:06:34,000 --> 00:06:35,000
[scoffs]

38
00:06:48,000 --> 00:06:50,000
The Queen needs your assistance now!

39
00:06:50,000 --> 00:06:52,000
We have to stop the bleeding!

40
00:06:56,000 --> 00:06:57,000
Come on. How is she?

41
00:06:58,000 --> 00:07:01,000
[Octopus Ant] It's not good.
She's in bad shape.

42
00:07:09,000 --> 00:07:11,000
If something isn't done…

43
00:07:11,000 --> 00:07:12,000
[grunts angrily]

44
00:07:18,000 --> 00:07:20,000
[Colt] Lord Neferpitou!

45
00:07:20,000 --> 00:07:23,000
The Queen's life is in grave danger.

46
00:07:36,000 --> 00:07:39,000
I only healed him because I need him
for reasons that are my own.

47
00:07:40,000 --> 00:07:46,000
And now that the King has been born,
I'm afraid she just doesn't matter to us.

48
00:07:46,000 --> 00:07:47,000
[gasps]

49
00:07:48,000 --> 00:07:51,000
We don't need that thing anymore.

50
00:07:51,000 --> 00:07:52,000
[gasps]

51
00:07:58,000 --> 00:07:59,000
[Bihorn] Your Majesty.

52
00:08:05,000 --> 00:08:08,000
Tell me,
will Lord Neferpitou grant us their help?

53
00:08:08,000 --> 00:08:10,000
The answer is no, I'm afraid.

54
00:08:21,000 --> 00:08:24,000
The Queen has suffered tremendous damage.

55
00:08:24,000 --> 00:08:27,000
And we simply don't have the power
to heal it.

56
00:08:29,000 --> 00:08:31,000
They may have the power that we need.

57
00:08:31,000 --> 00:08:33,000
Wait, who are you talking about?

58
00:08:34,000 --> 00:08:35,000
Hey, where are you going?

59
00:08:41,000 --> 00:08:45,000
We have already prepared a feast for you
up on the roof, which has a fine view.

60
00:08:51,000 --> 00:08:52,000
[loud crashing]

61
00:08:55,000 --> 00:08:57,000
[Neferpitou] That was excellent.

62
00:09:44,000 --> 00:09:47,000
That looks like fun. [grunts]

63
00:10:18,000 --> 00:10:19,000
[spits]

64
00:10:20,000 --> 00:10:21,000
Disgusting.

65
00:10:21,000 --> 00:10:23,000
[Neferpitou] You don't like it?

66
00:10:23,000 --> 00:10:25,000
I don't. It's horrendously bland.

67
00:10:25,000 --> 00:10:28,000
I'm afraid we don't use
any seasonings, sire.

68
00:10:36,000 --> 00:10:39,000
I would receive the most extremely
luscious nourishment.

69
00:10:39,000 --> 00:10:43,000
Yes, you must be talking about
the ones we call Rares, sire.

70
00:10:49,000 --> 00:10:51,000
More than you could know.

71
00:10:52,000 --> 00:10:55,000
[Neferpitou] As you wish, sire.
In that case…

72
00:11:07,000 --> 00:11:10,000
One of the damn Ants
is heading right for us.

73
00:11:10,000 --> 00:11:11,000
Have we been spotted?

74
00:11:12,000 --> 00:11:13,000
-I say we hide.
-Wait.

75
00:11:14,000 --> 00:11:17,000
Something doesn't quite feel right.
Look at that.

76
00:11:26,000 --> 00:11:27,000
A white flag?

77
00:11:33,000 --> 00:11:35,000
I have come here to surrender.

78
00:11:35,000 --> 00:11:36,000
[both gasp]

79
00:11:51,000 --> 00:11:54,000
She is no longer capable of giving birth.

80
00:11:54,000 --> 00:11:56,000
Wait. What are you saying?

81
00:11:56,000 --> 00:11:58,000
The King has already been born.

82
00:11:59,000 --> 00:12:02,000
-That's impossible.
-It's too soon.

83
00:12:02,000 --> 00:12:03,000
[grunts angrily]

84
00:12:18,000 --> 00:12:19,000
They are all…

85
00:12:20,000 --> 00:12:21,000
evil.

86
00:12:29,000 --> 00:12:30,000
[grunts]

87
00:12:37,000 --> 00:12:38,000
[loud crashing]

88
00:13:15,000 --> 00:13:17,000
[Neferpitou] Might I offer some advice?

89
00:13:34,000 --> 00:13:35,000
[inaudible]

90
00:13:40,000 --> 00:13:41,000
Ah, like this?

91
00:13:41,000 --> 00:13:43,000
Yes, exactly.

92
00:13:57,000 --> 00:14:00,000
I see. It isn't bad.

93
00:14:01,000 --> 00:14:03,000
Still… [spits]

94
00:14:04,000 --> 00:14:05,000
It's not at all worth eating.

95
00:14:06,000 --> 00:14:08,000
Not when you compare it to the Rares.

96
00:14:09,000 --> 00:14:11,000
Might I offer you some more advice?

97
00:14:19,000 --> 00:14:21,000
Do you dare to mock me?

98
00:14:21,000 --> 00:14:27,000
I am aware that one can see the energy
surrounding a body by focusing the eyes.

99
00:14:33,000 --> 00:14:36,000
I hope you can forgive my insolence.

100
00:14:55,000 --> 00:14:57,000
I intended to kill you with that blow.

101
00:14:57,000 --> 00:14:59,000
You have earned my respect.

102
00:15:01,000 --> 00:15:02,000
I am not worthy, sire.

103
00:15:05,000 --> 00:15:07,000
[Bihorn] No. I don't believe it.

104
00:15:13,000 --> 00:15:14,000
[Panda Ant] That's not quite right.

105
00:15:15,000 --> 00:15:19,000
The King, well,
he seems completely different from us.

106
00:15:19,000 --> 00:15:21,000
We're like all other creatures to him.

107
00:15:22,000 --> 00:15:24,000
Nothing more than food.

108
00:15:26,000 --> 00:15:28,000
In that case,
what do you think we should do now?

109
00:15:29,000 --> 00:15:30,000
What are you talking about?

110
00:15:31,000 --> 00:15:35,000
I'm saying that if the Queen dies,
then we really have no reason to stay.

111
00:15:41,000 --> 00:15:44,000
The Queen can't even reproduce anymore.
So what the hell's the point?

112
00:15:44,000 --> 00:15:45,000
[Bihorn gasps]

113
00:15:46,000 --> 00:15:48,000
-That's true, I suppose.
-[Bihorn] Huh?

114
00:15:49,000 --> 00:15:53,000
[Leol] It's no longer possible
for the Queen to maintain her kingdom.

115
00:15:53,000 --> 00:15:57,000
And in that case, I don't see why
we shouldn't all try to become a king.

116
00:16:08,000 --> 00:16:11,000
Something tells me we're not alone.

117
00:16:11,000 --> 00:16:14,000
There are others
who would like to get out of here as well.

118
00:16:22,000 --> 00:16:23,000
[both gasp]

119
00:16:26,000 --> 00:16:27,000
Hey, you guys!

120
00:16:39,000 --> 00:16:42,000
Help us. There isn't much time left.

121
00:16:42,000 --> 00:16:45,000
If the Queen dies,
the squad leaders will be unleashed.

122
00:16:45,000 --> 00:16:47,000
It will be chaos.

123
00:16:47,000 --> 00:16:49,000
What exactly will happen then?

124
00:16:50,000 --> 00:16:53,000
Most likely, they will imitate the King.

125
00:16:54,000 --> 00:16:59,000
They will start spreading their seed,
and building their own kingdoms.

126
00:17:13,000 --> 00:17:17,000
Yes. They're able to mate
with females of other species.

127
00:17:23,000 --> 00:17:26,000
the soldiers will never attempt
to procreate on their own.

128
00:17:27,000 --> 00:17:31,000
But I have read reports of soldiers who,
after the death of their Queen,

129
00:17:47,000 --> 00:17:50,000
Well, Colt,
we're going to take you to our boss

130
00:17:50,000 --> 00:17:52,000
so you two can have a little chat.

131
00:17:52,000 --> 00:17:56,000
Be honest with him,
and tell him everything you just told us.

132
00:17:56,000 --> 00:18:01,000
However, there's no guarantee
he's gonna believe your story.

133
00:18:01,000 --> 00:18:03,000
And even if he does,

134
00:18:03,000 --> 00:18:07,000
well, he may not let you leave,
not alive, anyway.

135
00:18:08,000 --> 00:18:10,000
So are you still willing to come?

136
00:18:10,000 --> 00:18:13,000
Yes, of course. Time is of the essence.

137
00:18:22,000 --> 00:18:25,000
Today's the day our apprentices do battle.

138
00:18:25,000 --> 00:18:27,000
Oh, yeah. I completely forgot.

139
00:18:29,000 --> 00:18:31,000
My money's on Knuckle and Shoot.

140
00:18:31,000 --> 00:18:37,000
And your money, one million of it,
is on all five showing up.

141
00:19:05,000 --> 00:19:06,000
-Hey, Knuckle.
-Yeah?

142
00:19:15,000 --> 00:19:18,000
Just promise me, that you'll save him.

143
00:19:26,000 --> 00:19:27,000
ROOK

144
00:19:27,000 --> 00:19:29,000
I swear on this tile.

145
00:19:58,000 --> 00:19:59,000
[screeching continues]

146
00:20:09,000 --> 00:20:10,000
[Gon] Killua.

147
00:20:27,000 --> 00:20:30,000
I… I never…

148
00:20:30,000 --> 00:20:31,000
[continues crying]

149
00:20:52,000 --> 00:20:54,000
could be so frustrating.

150
00:21:40,000 --> 00:21:41,000
[Killua] Gon…

151
00:21:43,000 --> 00:21:45,000
for the 30 days that you can't use Nen,

152
00:21:46,000 --> 00:21:48,000
I'll protect you.

153
00:21:50,000 --> 00:21:53,000
Whatever it takes, I'll keep you safe.

154
00:22:07,000 --> 00:22:09,000
[closing theme music playing]

155
00:23:40,000 --> 00:23:41,000
[both gasp]

156
00:23:43,000 --> 00:23:45,000
[singer singing in Japanese]
